Congratulations, Chris.

558
00:42:18,280 --> 00:42:20,680
And thank you for showing me

559
00:42:21,240 --> 00:42:23,520
that there's more to life

560
00:42:23,600 --> 00:42:25,920
than being consumed by hatred.

561
00:42:26,800 --> 00:42:28,880
"And forgive us our debts,

562
00:42:30,000 --> 00:42:32,640
as we also have forgiven our debtors."

563
00:42:33,640 --> 00:42:35,000
Matthew, chapter six,

564
00:42:35,800 --> 00:42:37,000
verse twelve.

565
00:42:39,440 --> 00:42:43,520
You didn't have to come
and meet me that day.

566
00:42:44,080 --> 00:42:45,120
Nalin.

567
00:42:46,320 --> 00:42:47,600
Chris.

568
00:42:49,920 --> 00:42:53,840
I was just a stranger

569
00:42:53,920 --> 00:42:55,960
with a suspicious story.

570
00:42:56,680 --> 00:42:59,360
But you still chose to come,

571
00:42:59,960 --> 00:43:02,400
because you believe other people's suffering

572
00:43:02,480 --> 00:43:05,000
is too important to ignore.

573
00:43:06,640 --> 00:43:11,760
I saw someone
still trying to do good for others,

574
00:43:12,800 --> 00:43:15,640
even when he needed help himself.

575
00:43:24,000 --> 00:43:25,120
God bless you.

576
00:43:25,200 --> 00:43:27,320
FREE MEALS FROM PORNHOVA CHURCH
AND TUANGTHAM LAW FIRM

577
00:43:28,720 --> 00:43:29,880
Did you come alone?

578
00:43:31,680 --> 00:43:33,360
How many people are in your family?

579
00:43:34,120 --> 00:43:35,720
- Four.
- Four?

580
00:43:35,960 --> 00:43:38,240
Then how about I give you six boxes?

581
00:43:41,360 --> 00:43:42,520
Here you go.

582
00:43:43,240 --> 00:43:44,400
Can you carry all that?

583
00:43:45,440 --> 00:43:46,960
Stay strong.

584
00:43:47,040 --> 00:43:48,560
God bless you.

585
00:43:56,360 --> 00:43:57,720
Even though you knew

586
00:43:57,800 --> 00:44:00,800
I came into your life with bad intentions,

587
00:44:03,040 --> 00:44:05,240
you still didn't abandon me.

588
00:44:14,960 --> 00:44:17,240
I truly saw the light.

589
00:44:18,760 --> 00:44:21,560
In that light, I saw the sky,

590
00:44:22,760 --> 00:44:24,200
the sea,

591
00:44:25,640 --> 00:44:27,840
my mom and my sister.

592
00:44:30,200 --> 00:44:32,360
No one was hurting anymore.

593
00:44:36,400 --> 00:44:37,720
We held hands

594
00:44:44,840 --> 00:44:46,120
and laughed together,

595
00:44:48,480 --> 00:44:49,840
and we were free.

596
00:44:52,480 --> 00:44:54,400
Thank you, Chris,
from the bottom of my heart.

597
00:44:54,960 --> 00:44:58,280
I hope you won't give up on yourself either.

598
00:44:58,760 --> 00:45:02,680
Someday we'll meet again in heaven.

599
00:45:03,040 --> 00:45:05,320
With love and heartfelt thanks.

600
00:45:22,320 --> 00:45:23,960
May I have one, please?

601
00:45:29,160 --> 00:45:30,160
Thank you.

602
00:45:31,440 --> 00:45:32,840
God bless you.

603
00:45:42,000 --> 00:45:43,280
Grandma?

604
00:45:46,000 --> 00:45:47,480
Grandma, are you here?

605
00:45:54,800 --> 00:45:56,280
Grandma?

606
00:46:29,440 --> 00:46:32,600
The more you hug me

607
00:46:32,680 --> 00:46:36,760
The more I feel trapped

608
00:46:36,840 --> 00:46:40,600
The more I think, the more we differ
The more I love, the farther you go

609
00:46:40,680 --> 00:46:44,040
The more it tears me apart

610
00:46:44,120 --> 00:46:48,240
If there's only one thing I could ask for

611
00:46:48,320 --> 00:46:52,080
I'd ask for it all to end

612
00:46:52,160 --> 00:46:58,160
I want to take my life
Far away from this hell

613
00:46:58,240 --> 00:47:00,600
Once and for all

614
00:47:00,680 --> 00:47:03,600
It's not love, it's hell

615
00:47:03,680 --> 00:47:07,600
This home is hell
I can't get out of here

616
00:47:08,120 --> 00:47:12,360
Even in your shade, I burn alive
